    {
      "title": "Emotional Response Class Notes",
      "start": 0,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "These class notes on the emotional response come down to two points.",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 4.08
        },
        {
          "text": "The first is to keep the circuitry to a minimum.",
          "start": 4.16,
          "end": 7.2
        },
        {
          "text": "What's important is to identify how each part of the brain really works, and how those parts work together.",
          "start": 7.28,
          "end": 13.68
        },
        {
          "text": "The second point is about the last exam, which is made up of fifty multiple-choice questions, to be completed in two hours.",
          "start": 13.76,
          "end": 20.88
        },
        {
          "text": "And that's the whole of these notes, short and to the point.",
          "start": 20.92,
          "end": 24.08
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
